#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:326
msgid ""
":func:`protocol.poll` is back. v5.0.0 removed it when the protocol task "
"moved to the timer; it returns as an explicit way to drive the task for "
"custom transports. Nothing else changed — scripts that never called it are "
"unaffected."
msgstr ""
":func:`protocol.poll` se vratio. v5.0.0 ga je uklonio kada je protokolni "
"zadatak prešao na timer; vraća se kao izričit način pokretanja zadatka za "
"prilagođene transporte. Ništa se drugo nije promijenilo — skripte koje ga "
"nikada nisu pozivale nisu pogođene."

