#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:338
msgid ""
"None of this affects MicroPython scripts. ``py_image.c`` was split, with the"
" descriptor objects (cascade, keypoints, LBP, keypoint match) moving to "
"``py_image_descriptor.c`` and the statistics objects (similarity, "
"statistics, percentile, threshold, histogram) to ``py_image_stats.c``. The "
"imlib encoder API was aligned with the rest of imlib: ``jpeg_compress`` / "
"``png_compress`` return ``0`` on success and ``-1`` on error, and "
"``jpeg_compress`` lost its ``realloc`` argument (resizing is gated on buffer"
" ownership). ``OMV_PROTOCOL_MAX_CHANNELS`` became "
"``OMV_PROTOCOL_CHANNEL_MAX`` in ``omv_protocol_channel.h``, and ports now "
"call ``py_protocol_init0()`` on init. The ``OMV_PAG7936_MIPI_CSI2`` board "
"define is gone (the interface is selected at runtime). CI dependency bumps "
"and an empty-release-changelog fix round it out. See the `firmware "
"repository <https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__ history for fork-relevant "
"detail."
msgstr ""
"Ništa od ovoga ne utječe na MicroPython skripte. ``py_image.c`` je "
"podijeljen, pri čemu su objekti deskriptora (cascade, keypoints, LBP, "
"keypoint match) premješteni u ``py_image_descriptor.c``\\ , a statistički "
"objekti (similarity, statistics, percentile, threshold, histogram) u "
"``py_image_stats.c``\\ . API imlib kodera usklađen je s ostatkom imliba: "
"``jpeg_compress`` / ``png_compress`` vraćaju ``0`` pri uspjehu i ``-1`` pri "
"grešci, a ``jpeg_compress`` je izgubio svoj argument ``realloc`` (promjena "
"veličine ovisi o vlasništvu nad međuspremnikom). "
"``OMV_PROTOCOL_MAX_CHANNELS`` postao je ``OMV_PROTOCOL_CHANNEL_MAX`` u "
"``omv_protocol_channel.h``\\ , a portovi sada pri inicijalizaciji pozivaju "
"``py_protocol_init0()``\\ . Definicija ploče ``OMV_PAG7936_MIPI_CSI2`` je "
"uklonjena (sučelje se odabire u vrijeme izvođenja). Sve zaokružuju "
"nadogradnje CI ovisnosti i ispravak praznog changeloga izdanja. Za detalje "
"relevantne za forkove pogledajte povijest `repozitorija ugrađenog programa "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:353
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Kontrolni popis za migraciju"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:355
msgid ""
"**Still on** ``import sensor``? It works, with a warning. Move to :mod:`csi`"
" (:ref:`v5.0.0 migration <v5_0_0_s1>`); replace ``disable_delays`` / "
"``disable_full_flush`` with the ``csi.CSI()`` constructor arguments and drop"
" ``get_fb`` / auto-rotation calls."
msgstr ""
"**Još uvijek na** ``import sensor``\\ ? Radi, uz upozorenje. Prijeđite na "
":mod:`csi` (\\ :ref:`migracija na v5.0.0 <v5_0_0_s1>`\\ ); zamijenite "
"``disable_delays`` / ``disable_full_flush`` argumentima konstruktora "
"``csi.CSI()`` i izbacite pozive ``get_fb`` / automatskog zakretanja."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:359
msgid ""
"**Load a single image with** ``copy_to_fb=True`` **and expect to see it?** "
"Add ``img.flush()`` after loading."
msgstr ""
"**Učitavate jednu sliku s** ``copy_to_fb=True`` **i očekujete da je "
"vidite?** Nakon učitavanja dodajte ``img.flush()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:361
msgid ""
"**Copied the YOLOv8 post-processor?** Index the thresholded output by row "
"(``bb[:, 4:]``) rather than by column."
msgstr ""
"**Kopirali ste YOLOv8 naknadni obrađivač?** Indeksirajte izlaz nakon praga "
"po retku (\\ ``bb[:, 4:]``\\ ), a ne po stupcu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:363
msgid ""
"**Compare** ``csi0.framesize()`` **after setting a tuple?** It now returns "
":data:`csi.CUSTOM`."
msgstr ""
"**Uspoređujete** ``csi0.framesize()`` **nakon postavljanja tuplea?** Sada "
"vraća :data:`csi.CUSTOM`\\ ."

